# Nubd Digital — Quantum Decision Landing Page (v4.0)

Single-file marketing landing page for **Quantum Decision** by **Nubd Digital**.

## Files

- `index.html` — the entire page. Embedded CSS + JS, no external image assets. All app visuals (phone mockup, Decision Superposition app screen) are hand-built CSS/SVG, not screenshots.
- `README.md` — this file.

## Tech

- Plain HTML/CSS/JS, no build step, no dependencies.
- Google Fonts (Inter) loaded via CDN link — the only external network request besides the Meta Pixel.
- Meta Pixel (ID `1788443058834444`, matches the existing brand kit) fires `PageView` on load and `InitiateCheckout` on every CTA click.

## Structure

1. Nav — glassmorphism, fixed top, logo + How it Works / Pricing + Start Free CTA
2. Hero — headline, stats, dual CTA, animated phone mockup with orbit rings
3. How It Works — 3-step process
4. Features — 6-card grid + large Decision Superposition app mockup (sidebar nav + 5 scenario cards)
5. Pricing — Free vs Premium ($29 one-time)
6. Final CTA — gradient callout panel
7. Footer — logo, links, social icons

## Brand

| Token | Value |
|---|---|
| Primary | `#6B21A8` |
| Secondary | `#3B82F6` |
| Accent | `#06B6D4` |
| Dark | `#0F0F1A` |
| Light | `#F8FAFC` |
| Muted | `#94A3B8` |

All CTAs link to `https://app.nubd-care.com`.

## Local preview

```bash
open index.html
```

## Deploy

Push this folder to a GitHub repo and enable GitHub Pages, pointed at the `nubd-care.com` domain (CNAME), to match the CTA links.
